  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/614",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>대기권의 층상구조</b>를 <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>종이로 만들어</b></span> 볼까합니다. 하하하;;;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">뻘쭘해서 웃어봅니다. ㅋ&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>앞장</b>이구요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca8a5db0fbf366291f54df9c48d2a6c6378a6a60\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca8a5db0fbf366291f54df9c48d2a6c6378a6a60\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>뒷장</b>입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">[양면인쇄 - 짧은 쪽으로 넘김]</span></b> 출력을 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/558bdfe16d6d0d2268eecf09f4fe5750d3466872\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/558bdfe16d6d0d2268eecf09f4fe5750d3466872\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">우선 A4 를<b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"> 반으로 접습니다.</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba095493ba72c46ea50604016d43f6f1043dc164\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba095493ba72c46ea50604016d43f6f1043dc164\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">교과서에 나온 높이당 기온값을 대충....표시해줍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">(비상교과서 54쪽을 기준으로 했습니다만....</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">권역 구분과 정확히 일치하진 않습니다.)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>11km, 50km, 80km, 110km</b> 네 군데의 값만</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">각 <b>-50도, -2도, -86도, -9도</b> 정도로 표시합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">점찍고 선긋기!</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d69adf50db778090375ac58da8aed68a7895eeba\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d69adf50db778090375ac58da8aed68a7895eeba\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">온도변화가 <b><span style=\"color: #f89009;\">큰 곳을 경계로</span></b> 권역 이름을 씁니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/528e712272a5679aa435da1d3f9f1aa62e0d14db\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/528e712272a5679aa435da1d3f9f1aa62e0d14db\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #0593d3;\">가위질은 딱 4군데만!&#160;</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>0km 부터</b></span> 10km, 50km, 80km 이렇게 네군데에 점까지만 오립니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e4049807f09c3febc4cbe2355fbd1d65bc1da57\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e4049807f09c3febc4cbe2355fbd1d65bc1da57\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">오렸으면 접기!</span></b></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f88aad2f83efa5fd3d1655a0abaa3174432a678b\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f88aad2f83efa5fd3d1655a0abaa3174432a678b\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db17971823c5fa98002da3594d46a190bb132a6d\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db17971823c5fa98002da3594d46a190bb132a6d\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">성층권과 중간권사이 겹지는 부분은</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #0db4a0;\">적당히 겹쳐 접어줍니다.</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">할 수 있어. 아이들아!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/600cb9389fdaf6ad121dcb8eac3dee14b99d9d40\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/600cb9389fdaf6ad121dcb8eac3dee14b99d9d40\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>대충~</b></span> 세워지게 말이죠.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d97dd775f8be5c09ffdef3938d1776326dd727a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d97dd775f8be5c09ffdef3938d1776326dd727a\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">뒤에 보이는 <span style=\"color: #0593d3;\"><b>각 권역별 특징을 그리고, </b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">메모 및 정리합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">끝!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f571af0b6ff02c4865c9875e921846b67195037\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0f571af0b6ff02c4865c9875e921846b67195037\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이게... 사실 만든 이유는요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">온도변화 곡선을 따라 오리면 <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>그 경사면이&#160;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>약간...직관적으로</b> </span><b>올라가는, 내려가는 모습이 되기 때문</b>이랍니다;;;;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아하하;;; ^^;;;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca6199cc52cc8fa610cce37632b04e685e5ad5e3\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca6199cc52cc8fa610cce37632b04e685e5ad5e3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/531d32b67fb28900b55dec259f254d7098bb8293\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/531d32b67fb28900b55dec259f254d7098bb8293\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/252b84ff5bb601baa9786ad8ebb8568ea2f0227f\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/252b84ff5bb601baa9786ad8ebb8568ea2f0227f\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90ae55f7a904971d08d11a9fe562da3aab9dfb51\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90ae55f7a904971d08d11a9fe562da3aab9dfb51\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">여튼 완성하였습니다. 끝!</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\"><b>코로나 조심하세요! ^^</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1ff49a0842d32c0bb18f57d3681211cfd8f0d29\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c1ff49a0842d32c0bb18f57d3681211cfd8f0d29\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/344fd6fe1136b7aadde228b6ea94557b9e14d52c?download\" data-file-name=\"기권의층상구조만들기_양면인쇄_짧은쪽으로넘김.hwp\" data-file-size=\"113152\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D614%26fileid%3D17%26regdt%3D20220413135121&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F344fd6fe1136b7aadde228b6ea94557b9e14d52c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">기권의층상구조만들기_양면인쇄_짧은쪽으로넘김</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">110.50KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
